{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium responsive Featured Products carousel section inspired by modern luxury fashion websites. The layout should match a high-end editorial product slider with large product imagery, spacious product cards, clean typography, and smooth interactions similar to the reference design provided.
    This should be a PRODUCT carousel section (not a featured collection grid) that pulls products from a selected collection while allowing users to horizontally scroll/swipe through all products. The carousel must feel smooth, modern, and optimized for both desktop and mobile.
    Requirements:
    
    
    Fully responsive layout
    
    
    Large premium-style product cards
    
    
    Horizontal sliding carousel
    
    
    Smooth scrolling behavior
    
    
    Desktop navigation arrows
    
    
    Touch/swipe support on mobile
    
    
    Mouse drag support on desktop
    
    
    Ability to scroll through all products in the collection
    
    
    Optimized loading and performance
    
    
    No horizontal white-space overflow issues on mobile
    
    
    Clean spacing and typography similar to premium streetwear/fashion stores
    
    
    Product Card Features:
    
    
    Large product image
    
    
    Product title
    
    
    Price
    
    
    Compare-at price
    
    
    Sale percentage or sale badge
    
    
    Optional sold out badge
    
    
    Hover animation
    
    
    On hover, reveal the second product image if available
    
    
    Smooth image zoom or fade transition on hover
    
    
    Optional quick add to cart button
    
    
    Optional wishlist icon
    
    
    Fully clickable product card
    
    
    Theme Editor Customization Settings:
    
    
    Collection picker
    
    
    Products per row (desktop/tablet/mobile)
    
    
    Number of products to show
    
    
    Product spacing
    
    
    Card border radius
    
    
    Section padding
    
    
    Background color
    
    
    Product title color
    
    
    Price color
    
    
    Compare-at price color
    
    
    Sale badge colors
    
    
    Arrow colors
    
    
    Hover effect toggle
    
    
    Autoplay toggle
    
    
    Autoplay speed
    
    
    Show/hide:
    
    
    sale badges
    
    
    compare-at prices
    
    
    arrows
    
    
    quick add button
    
    
    vendor
    
    
    product ratings
    
    
    
    
    Design Requirements:
    
    
    Match a premium luxury streetwear aesthetic
    
    
    Large centered headings
    
    
    Spacious layout
    
    
    Clean typography
    
    
    Smooth animations
    
    
    Minimal but modern design
    
    
    High-end mobile responsiveness
    
    
    Cards should scale properly on all screen sizes
    
    
    Prevent compressed product cards on mobile
    
    
    Maintain smooth swipe behavior without lag
    
    
    Carousel Behavior:
    
    
    Smooth snapping scroll
    
    
    Infinite-feeling navigation if possible
    
    
    Arrow navigation on desktop
    
    
    Swipe gestures on mobile
    
    
    Drag-to-scroll support
    
    
    Optional autoplay with pause on hover
    
    
    Technical Requirements:
    
    
    Shopify Online Store 2.0 compatible
    
    
    Use schema settings for all customization
    
    
    Highly optimized and lightweight
    
    
    Lazy load images
    
    
    Use responsive image sizing
    
    
    Ensure accessibility support
    
    
    Ensure no layout shifting
    
    
    Maintain fast performance scores
    
    
    The final result should feel like a premium fashion brand homepage carousel rather than a standard Shopify collection slider., Update the featured products carousel section with improved image scaling and hover-image sizing behavior.
    
    Currently the product images and especially the secondary hover image are too zoomed in on both desktop and mobile. The hover image should match the exact same scale, positioning, proportions, and framing as the primary product image.
    
    Make the following updates:
    
    Reduce overall image zoom/cropping inside product cards
    Ensure both primary and secondary images use identical sizing and positioning
    Prevent the hover image from appearing enlarged compared to the first image
    Maintain full product visibility without cutting off hoodies/pants/etc.
    Preserve product proportions naturally
    Improve desktop image framing so products appear slightly smaller and more premium inside the card
    Add more breathing room around products inside image containers
    Ensure images remain centered vertically and horizontally
    Keep image quality sharp while reducing crop intensity
    
    Image Behavior Requirements:
    
    Use a contain-style or softer cover-style fit instead of aggressive cropping
    Maintain consistent aspect ratio across all products
    Keep hover transitions smooth without scaling distortion
    Remove any excessive zoom transform on hover
    Product imagery should resemble luxury editorial fashion layouts with visible whitespace around garments
    
    Desktop Layout Improvements:
    
    Slightly reduce image size inside cards
    Increase spacing between products slightly
    Ensure products do not touch card edges
    Maintain premium oversized layout while improving balance
    
    Mobile Improvements:
    
    Prevent image cutoff on smaller screens
    Ensure hover/reveal image scales properly on tap/swipe devices
    Keep cards clean and readable without oversized imagery
    
    Do NOT redesign the section — only refine and optimize the product image sizing, scaling, hover reveal behavior, and framing while preserving the existing carousel structure and styling, Update the featured products section so it no longer scrolls horizontally as a carousel. Instead, convert it into a vertically scrolling responsive products layout while keeping the same premium aesthetic, hover effects, animations, and product card design.
    
    The section should now behave like a luxury fashion product feed/grid rather than a horizontal slider.
    
    Main Changes:
    
    Remove horizontal scrolling completely
    Products should stack naturally in rows and continue downward vertically
    User should scroll down the page to see all products
    Preserve the premium oversized product card design
    Keep the same responsive behavior and clean spacing
    Maintain smooth hover effects and second-image reveal
    
    Product Card Size Customization:
    Add highly customizable controls for product card sizing directly in the Shopify theme editor.
    
    I want to be able to:
    
    Scale product cards by percentage
    Control image size independently
    Adjust product card width
    Adjust product card height
    Adjust content spacing
    Adjust image container padding
    Adjust overall card scaling
    Adjust card max-width
    Adjust image aspect ratio
    Adjust product image fit behavior
    Adjust typography sizing
    Adjust price sizing
    Adjust product title sizing
    Adjust spacing between products
    Adjust row spacing separately from column spacing
    
    Add Theme Editor Settings For:
    
    Product card scale (%) slider
    Product image scale (%) slider
    Card width slider
    Card height slider
    Product image padding
    Product title font size
    Price font size
    Compare-at price font size
    Grid spacing
    Row spacing
    Column spacing
    Desktop products per row
    Tablet products per row
    Mobile products per row
    Product image aspect ratio
    Card border radius
    Card shadow intensity
    Hover animation intensity
    Hover image zoom intensity
    Image fit mode (contain / cover)
    Max content width
    
    Layout Requirements:
    
    Fully responsive grid layout
    Clean vertical product feed
    Luxury fashion aesthetic
    Spacious layout with balanced whitespace
    Optimized for large apparel imagery
    No cropped or oversized product images
    Smooth responsive scaling across all devices
    No mobile overflow issues
    Products should feel balanced and centered
    
    Image Requirements:
    
    Maintain improved image framing from previous update
    Secondary hover image must match primary image sizing exactly
    No aggressive zooming
    Keep whitespace around garments
    Prevent clipping/cropping of hoodies, pants, or full outfits
    Maintain premium editorial-style framing
    
    Keep Existing Features:
    
    Sale badges
    Compare-at pricing
    Hover reveal second image
    Hover animation
    Quick add support if enabled
    Fully customizable colors
    Collection picker
    Responsive typography
    Shopify Online Store 2.0 compatibility
    
    Do not rebuild the section from scratch — modify the existing premium products section and convert the layout behavior from horizontal carousel scrolling into a vertically scrolling responsive product grid with advanced product card customization controls., Refine the existing featured products grid section with one final sizing adjustment:
    
    
    Reduce the overall product card/container size by approximately 5%
    
    
    Increase the actual product image size inside the card by approximately 5%
    
    
    The goal is to make the products appear larger and more prominent while reducing unnecessary empty card space/background around them.
    Specific Changes:
    
    
    Slightly shrink card padding and outer container dimensions
    
    
    Slightly enlarge the product imagery within the image container
    
    
    Reduce excess whitespace beneath images
    
    
    Keep the layout balanced and premium
    
    
    Maintain the luxury editorial aesthetic
    
    
    Ensure images remain fully visible without cropping
    
    
    Preserve all existing hover effects and second-image reveal behavior
    
    
    Keep secondary hover image perfectly matched in scale and positioning to the primary image
    
    
    Layout Goals:
    
    
    More image-focused
    
    
    Tighter and cleaner card proportions
    
    
    Less dead space
    
    
    Products should visually dominate the card more
    
    
    Maintain responsive scaling across desktop/tablet/mobile
    
    
    Do not redesign the section — only fine-tune the proportions so the cards feel slightly more compact while the apparel imagery feels slightly larger and more premium.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.container_padding }}px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.subheading_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.heading_transform }};
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    {% if block.settings.products_per_row_mobile == '1' %}
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    {% else %}
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    {% endif %}
    gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing_mobile }}px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    transform: scale({{ block.settings.card_scale | times: 0.95 | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    {% if block.settings.card_max_width > 0 %}
      max-width: {{ block.settings.card_max_width }}px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.card_shadow_intensity > 0 %}
      box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 2 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 8 }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.enable_hover_lift %}
      transform: scale({{ block.settings.card_scale | times: 0.95 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) translateY(-{{ block.settings.hover_lift_intensity }}px);
      {% if block.settings.card_shadow_intensity > 0 %}
        box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 3 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 12 }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 1.5 | divided_by: 100.0 }});
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_aspect_ratio }}%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
    {% if block.settings.image_padding > 0 %}
      padding: {{ block.settings.image_padding }}px;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: {{ block.settings.image_scale | times: 1.05 }}%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_scale | times: 1.05 }}%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit }};
    object-position: center;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.primary {
    opacity: 1;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.secondary {
    opacity: 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effect %}
    .ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.primary {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.secondary {
      opacity: 1;
      {% if block.settings.hover_image_zoom > 0 %}
        transform: scale({{ 1 | plus: block.settings.hover_image_zoom | divided_by: 100.0 }});
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-premium-grid__badges-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}.sale {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_text }};
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}.sold-out {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.sold_out_badge_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.sold_out_badge_text }};
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__quick-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-premium-grid__quick-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__action-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.action_btn_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.action_btn_color }};
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__action-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.action_btn_hover_bg }};
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__action-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_content_padding | times: 0.85 }}px;
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_vendor %}
    .ai-premium-grid__vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: {{ block.settings.vendor_color }};
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-premium-grid__title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing | times: 0.85 }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-premium-grid__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_compare_price %}
    .ai-premium-grid__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_price_size }}px;
      color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
      text-decoration: line-through;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
  {% endif %}

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-premium-grid__products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.products_per_row_tablet }}, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing_tablet }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-premium-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 1.2 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-premium-grid__products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.products_per_row_desktop }}, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-premium-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 1.5 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-premium-grid__quick-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-premium-grid__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-premium-grid__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-premium-grid__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <p class="ai-premium-grid__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-premium-grid__products-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
        {% assign products_to_show = block.settings.products_limit %}
        {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: products_to_show %}
          <div class="ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-premium-grid__title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-premium-grid__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-premium-grid__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="800"
                      height="{{ 800 | times: block.settings.image_aspect_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                      class="ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} primary"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  {% endif %}

                  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effect and product.images[1] %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.images[1] | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.images[1].alt | escape }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="800"
                      height="{{ 800 | times: block.settings.image_aspect_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                      class="ai-premium-grid__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} secondary"
                    >
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="ai-premium-grid__badges-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if block.settings.show_sale_badge and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                    {% if block.settings.sale_badge_type == 'percentage' %}
                      {% assign discount = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                      <span class="ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} sale">-{{ discount }}%</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span class="ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} sale">Sale</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  {% endif %}

                  {% if block.settings.show_sold_out_badge and product.available == false %}
                    <span class="ai-premium-grid__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} sold-out">Sold Out</span>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                {% if block.settings.show_quick_add or block.settings.show_wishlist %}
                  <div class="ai-premium-grid__quick-actions-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if block.settings.show_wishlist %}
                      <button class="ai-premium-grid__action-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Add to wishlist">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                          <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </button>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if block.settings.show_quick_add and product.available %}
                      <button class="ai-premium-grid__action-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Quick add">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                          <circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
                          <circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
                          <path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </button>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </a>

            <div class="ai-premium-grid__info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.show_vendor and product.vendor %}
                <div class="ai-premium-grid__vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
              {% endif %}

              <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-premium-grid__title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-premium-grid__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
              </a>

              <div class="ai-premium-grid__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-premium-grid__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                {% if block.settings.show_compare_price and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  <span class="ai-premium-grid__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          <div class="ai-premium-grid__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-premium-grid__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-premium-grid__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-premium-grid__info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-premium-grid__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Product Title</h3>
              <div class="ai-premium-grid__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-premium-grid__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$99.00</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class PremiumGrid{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    constructor() {
      super();
    }

    connectedCallback() {
    }
  }

